{"seq":2,"slug":"debugging-with-ai","title":"调试与排错","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/practice/debugging-with-ai","wordCount":1442,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"调试与排错\">调试与排错</h1><h2 id=\"场景描述\">场景描述</h2><p>调试是开发中最耗时的活动之一。传统调试依赖开发者的经验和直觉——逐行阅读代码、设置断点、分析日志。AI 的加入改变了这一流程：它可以快速理解错误信息、提出假设、建议修复方案，并帮助你分析大量日志数据。关键在于掌握<strong>如何有效地将调试问题传递给 AI</strong>，以及<strong>何时该信任 AI 的诊断结果</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    BUG[&quot;🐛 Bug Found&quot;] --&gt; SHARE[&quot;Pass Context to AI&quot;]&#10;    SHARE --&gt; DIAGNOSE[&quot;AI-Assisted Diagnosis&quot;]&#10;    DIAGNOSE --&gt; FIX[&quot;Generate Fix&quot;]&#10;    FIX --&gt; VERIFY[&quot;Verify Fix&quot;]&#10;    VERIFY --&gt;|&quot;Unresolved&quot;| SHARE&#10;    VERIFY --&gt;|&quot;Resolved&quot;| DONE[&quot;✅ Issue Closed&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    BUG[\"🐛 Bug Found\"] --&gt; SHARE[\"Pass Context to AI\"]\n    SHARE --&gt; DIAGNOSE[\"AI-Assisted Diagnosis\"]\n    DIAGNOSE --&gt; FIX[\"Generate Fix\"]\n    FIX --&gt; VERIFY[\"Verify Fix\"]\n    VERIFY --&gt;|\"Unresolved\"| SHARE\n    VERIFY --&gt;|\"Resolved\"| DONE[\"✅ Issue Closed\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>AI 辅助调试把经典的四步闭环——<strong>复现 → 定位 → 修复 → 验证</strong>——中的每一步都用 AI 加速，但它的效果几乎完全由&quot;喂给 AI 的错误信息质量&quot;决定。因此核心心智模型只有两条：一是<strong>错误信息即上下文</strong>，完整的堆栈、相关代码、复现步骤和期望行为缺一不可，模糊描述只会换来猜测；二是<strong>AI 擅长有明确报错的问题</strong>，而非确定性复现的竞态、环境特定问题、内存泄漏等仍需回归传统调试工具。理解了这两条边界，就自然明白何时该用 AI、何时该自己上 profiler。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心原则\">核心原则</h2><h3 id=\"复现-定位-修复-验证\">复现→定位→修复→验证</h3><p>AI 辅助调试同样遵循经典的四步闭环，但每一步都可以借助 AI 加速：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    R[&quot;1. Reproduce&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;2. Diagnose&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;3. Fix&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; V[&quot;4. Verify&quot;]&#10;    V --&gt;|&quot;Issue recurs&quot;| R&#10;    V --&gt;|&quot;Pass&quot;| CLOSE[&quot;Close&quot;]&#10;&#10;    R -.- R_AI[&quot;AI Assists:&lt;br/&gt;Generate minimal repro&quot;]&#10;    D -.- D_AI[&quot;AI Assists:&lt;br/&gt;Analyze errors &amp; logs&quot;]&#10;    F -.- F_AI[&quot;AI Assists:&lt;br/&gt;Generate fix code&quot;]&#10;    V -.- V_AI[&quot;AI Assists:&lt;br/&gt;Generate regression tests&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    R[\"1. Reproduce\"] --&gt; D[\"2. Diagnose\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"3. Fix\"]\n    F --&gt; V[\"4. Verify\"]\n    V --&gt;|\"Issue recurs\"| R\n    V --&gt;|\"Pass\"| CLOSE[\"Close\"]\n\n    R -.- R_AI[\"AI Assists:&lt;br/&gt;Generate minimal repro\"]\n    D -.- D_AI[\"AI Assists:&lt;br/&gt;Analyze errors &amp; logs\"]\n    F -.- F_AI[\"AI Assists:&lt;br/&gt;Generate fix code\"]\n    V -.- V_AI[\"AI Assists:&lt;br/&gt;Generate regression tests\"]</pre><h3 id=\"错误信息是最重要的上下文\">错误信息是最重要的上下文</h3><p>AI 诊断问题的质量直接取决于你提供的错误信息的<strong>完整性</strong>和<strong>准确性</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信息质量</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>AI 诊断效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>❌ 极差</td>\n<td>&quot;代码报错了&quot;</td>\n<td>无法定位，只能猜测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>⚠️ 一般</td>\n<td>&quot;编译时类型错误&quot;</td>\n<td>方向正确但不够精确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>✅ 良好</td>\n<td>完整错误堆栈 + 相关代码</td>\n<td>能准确定位问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>✅ 优秀</td>\n<td>错误堆栈 + 代码 + 复现步骤 + 期望行为</td>\n<td>能直接给出修复方案</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 永远复制粘贴完整的错误信息文本，而不是截图或口头描述。AI 需要精确的错误代码和堆栈信息来定位问题。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"操作步骤\">操作步骤</h2><h3 id=\"步骤一-收集并整理错误信息\">步骤一：收集并整理错误信息</h3><p>在向 AI 求助之前，先系统化地收集所有相关信息：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 收集编译错误&#10;npm run build 2&gt;&amp;1 | tee build-error.log&#10;&#10;# 收集运行时错误和堆栈跟踪&#10;node dist/index.js 2&gt;&amp;1 | tee runtime-error.log&#10;&#10;# 收集测试失败信息&#10;npm test -- --verbose 2&gt;&amp;1 | tee test-error.log&#10;&#10;# 收集最近的 git 变更（定位引入 Bug 的提交）&#10;git log --oneline -10&#10;git diff HEAD~3 -- src/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 收集编译错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 2>&#x26;1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tee</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build-error.log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 收集运行时错误和堆栈跟踪</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">node</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dist/index.js</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 2>&#x26;1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tee</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> runtime-error.log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 收集测试失败信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --verbose</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 2>&#x26;1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tee</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test-error.log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 收集最近的 git 变更（定位引入 Bug 的提交）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --oneline</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> diff</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD~3</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"步骤二-构建调试请求\">步骤二：构建调试请求</h3><p>使用结构化的格式向 AI 描述问题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"## 问题描述&#10;&#10;在执行用户注册流程时，提交表单后返回 500 错误。&#10;&#10;## 错误信息&#10;&#10;```&#10;TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading &#39;email&#39;) at validateUser (src/validators/user.ts:23:18) at registerHandler (src/routes/auth.ts:45:12) at Layer.handle (node_modules/express/lib/router/layer.js:95:5)&#10;```&#10;&#10;## 相关代码&#10;&#10;```typescript&#10;// src/validators/user.ts:20-30&#10;function validateUser(body: unknown): ValidationResult {&#10;  const { email, password, name } = body as UserInput;&#10;  if (!email.includes(&#39;@&#39;)) {&#10;    // 第 23 行&#10;    return { valid: false, error: &#39;邮箱格式不正确&#39; };&#10;  }&#10;  return { valid: true };&#10;}&#10;```&#10;&#10;## 复现步骤&#10;&#10;1. POST /api/auth/register&#10;2. Body: { &quot;password&quot;: &quot;123456&quot; }（缺少 email 字段）&#10;3. 返回 500 而非预期的 400 验证错误&#10;&#10;## 期望行为&#10;&#10;缺少必填字段时应返回 400 状态码和具体的错误提示。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 问题描述</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">在执行用户注册流程时，提交表单后返回 500 错误。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 错误信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">```</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'email') at validateUser (src/validators/user.ts:23:18) at registerHandler (src/routes/auth.ts:45:12) at Layer.handle (node_modules/express/lib/router/layer.js:95:5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">```</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 相关代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">```typescript</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// src/validators/user.ts:20-30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> validateUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">body</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ValidationResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">email</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">password</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">email.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 第 23 行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { valid: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, error: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'邮箱格式不正确'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { valid: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">```</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 复现步骤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">1.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> POST /api/auth/register</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">2.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Body: { \"password\": \"123456\" }（缺少 email 字段）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">3.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 返回 500 而非预期的 400 验证错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 期望行为</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">缺少必填字段时应返回 400 状态码和具体的错误提示。</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"步骤三-ai-辅助日志分析\">步骤三：AI 辅助日志分析</h3><p>面对大量日志数据时，AI 可以快速提取关键信息：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 从大量日志中提取错误模式&#10;cat application.log | grep -E &quot;ERROR|WARN&quot; | tail -50\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 从大量日志中提取错误模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> application.log</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -E</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"ERROR|WARN\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tail</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -50</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"将以下日志片段发送给 AI 并提问：&#10;&#10;&quot;以下是应用在过去 1 小时内的错误日志。请帮我：&#10;1. 识别出现频率最高的错误类型&#10;2. 分析这些错误之间是否存在关联&#10;3. 按优先级排列需要修复的问题&#10;&#10;[2026-03-29 10:15:23] ERROR: Connection timeout to database (retry 3/3)&#10;[2026-03-29 10:15:24] ERROR: Failed to fetch user profile: ECONNREFUSED&#10;[2026-03-29 10:15:24] WARN: Cache miss for key user:1234&#10;[2026-03-29 10:15:25] ERROR: Request handler timeout after 30000ms&#10;[2026-03-29 10:15:30] ERROR: Connection timeout to database (retry 3/3)&#10;[2026-03-29 10:15:31] ERROR: Unhandled rejection: Database connection lost&#10;...&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>将以下日志片段发送给 AI 并提问：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"以下是应用在过去 1 小时内的错误日志。请帮我：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. 识别出现频率最高的错误类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 分析这些错误之间是否存在关联</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 按优先级排列需要修复的问题</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[2026-03-29 10:15:23] ERROR: Connection timeout to database (retry 3/3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[2026-03-29 10:15:24] ERR